{"id":"snaruzhi","lemma":"снаружи","pos":"adv","rank":641,"glosses":["on the outside, from the outside, outwardly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/17/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хочу остаться снаружи.","en":"I want to stay outside.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653926","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to remain, to stay"},null]},{"text":"Иди подожди снаружи.","en":"Go wait outside.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"to wait","l":"подождать"},null]},{"text":"Идите подождите снаружи.","en":"Go wait outside.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"to wait","l":"подождать"},null]},{"text":"Мы были снаружи.","en":"We were outside.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Можешь подождать снаружи?","en":"Can you wait outside?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to wait"},null]}]}